 989:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_dma_ex.c **** 
 990:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****       (+) The HAL_DMAEx_List_InsertNode_Head() and HAL_DMAEx_List_InsertNode_Tail() functions allow
 991:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****           linked-list node to the head (respectively the tail) of static linked-list queue.
