 993:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****       (+) The HAL_DMAEx_List_RemoveNode() function allows to remove selected built linked-list node
